A version file with no lens, whose schema requires a field beneath a struct
the prior version has: the block the help offers nests the field in its
struct, as CUE writes it, rather than naming it by its dotted path.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
	}
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0209]: immutability violation: v1.0 is under history/, and has an error
 --> history/1.0.thema:1:1
  |
1 | Schema: {
  | ^^^^^^
  |
  = note: a version under history/ never changes once it is cut, and had no error when it was cut, so since then its file, another file under history/, or thema has changed, or the file was never cut
  = help: find which file under history/ changed since it was cut, restore it, and make the change in tip.thema

error[E0346]: v1.0 has no ForwardLens, and v1.0 requires meta.team
 --> history/1.0.thema:7:1
  |
7 | }
